  "choice_text": "**L1 at the budget operating point** is the default (`{\"window\": 60, \"alpha\": 0.2, \"threshold\": 2.1532, \"floor_fraction\": 0.25}`). It was picked on VALIDATION: at \u2264 1.0 false alarm/hour it detects 57.5% of VALIDATION episodes vs 22.0% for L2. On TEST: episode recall 57.7% vs 27.3%, row F1 21.4% vs 2.6%, false alarms/hour 1.58 vs 1.08 \u2014 TEST agrees with the VALIDATION choice.\n\nThe original plan (best VALIDATION row F1) would have picked **L2-F1** (25.7% VALIDATION F1). It was not used as the service default because its threshold flags 305 false alarms/hour on the normal TEST run, which no alerting service could act on. The scoring service also returns the L0 result alongside for comparison.",
